22:["$","div",null,{"className":"shell article-layout","children":[["$","aside",null,{"className":"article-toc","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"In this guide"}],["$","ol",null,{"children":[["$","li","The name can be confusing",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#section-0","children":"The name can be confusing"}]}],["$","li","Use a precise scheduling question",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#section-1","children":"Use a precise scheduling question"}]}],["$","li","Bring the pieces of your prevention history",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#section-2","children":"Bring the pieces of your prevention history"}]}],["$","li","Leave with a plan you can use",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#section-3","children":"Leave with a plan you can use"}]}]]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"arrow-link","href":"/dr-elsaadi-preview/care/primary-preventive-care.html","children":["Explore ","primary & preventive care"," →"]}]]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"guide-body","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"key-takeaway","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Start here"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Medicare’s Annual Wellness Visit is a prevention-planning visit, not a routine head-to-toe physical."}]]}],[["$","section","The name can be confusing",{"id":"section-0","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"The name can be confusing"}],[["$","p","Under Original Medicare, the yearly wellness benefit generally becomes available after the first 12 months of Part B and can be used once every 12 months. It focuses on a personalized prevention plan. A routine physical is a different service and is not covered by Original Medicare.",{"children":"Under Original Medicare, the yearly wellness benefit generally becomes available after the first 12 months of Part B and can be used once every 12 months. It focuses on a personalized prevention plan. A routine physical is a different service and is not covered by Original Medicare."}],["$","p","If the clinician accepts assignment, the covered wellness visit has no patient cost. Additional services, tests or treatment can carry costs. Your own coverage and timing should be confirmed before scheduling.",{"children":"If the clinician accepts assignment, the covered wellness visit has no patient cost. Additional services, tests or treatment can carry costs. Your own coverage and timing should be confirmed before scheduling."}]],false]}],["$","section","Use a precise scheduling question",{"id":"section-1","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Use a precise scheduling question"}],[["$","p","Instead of asking only for “my annual,” try: “I would like to discuss a Medicare Annual Wellness Visit. Can you help confirm when I am eligible and whether my other concerns need a separate appointment?”",{"children":"Instead of asking only for “my annual,” try: “I would like to discuss a Medicare Annual Wellness Visit. Can you help confirm when I am eligible and whether my other concerns need a separate appointment?”"}],["$","p","Tell the office if you also want to discuss a new symptom, an ongoing condition or a medication problem. Staff can help identify the appropriate visit arrangement. Do not assume that mentioning an issue makes it part of the wellness benefit.",{"children":"Tell the office if you also want to discuss a new symptom, an ongoing condition or a medication problem. Staff can help identify the appropriate visit arrangement. Do not assume that mentioning an issue makes it part of the wellness benefit."}]],false]}],["$","section","Bring the pieces of your prevention history",{"id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Bring the pieces of your prevention history"}],[["$","p","You do not need to remember everything. Write “not sure” when you do not know a date, and identify the office that may have the record.",{"children":"You do not need to remember everything. Write “not sure” when you do not know a date, and identify the office that may have the record."}]],"$L27"]}],"$L28"],"$L29","$L2a","$L2b"]}]]}]
